% expect-output: /undefinedfilename
% Scenario: file with no capability configured never reaches the host.
% Expect: prints "/undefinedfilename"; no host file is opened.
{ (/etc/passwd) (r) file } stopped pop
$error /errorname get ==  % /undefinedfilename
